── UNKNOWN NAME ───────────────────── E0211_rust_assert_eq_macro.lt:4:3  [E0211]

Stilt has no `assert_eq!`: an assertion is written `assert a == b`:

  4 │   assert_eq!(2 + 2, 4)
    │   ^^^^^^^^^

`assert` is a statement, which checks a `bool`.

To fix it, write an `assert`:

  4 │   assert 2 + 2 == 4
    │   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
